    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a777087349f7a55755a281</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 11:03:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>游戏毫无意义？那为什么我们还这么爱玩游戏，让我们了解被忽略的游戏一面。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期播客主要内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>游戏的负面观点与原因</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何正确的看待游戏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>游戏有什么意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我们为什么会喜欢玩游戏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>什么样的游戏才是好游戏</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的游戏：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《cs》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《王者荣耀》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《to the moon》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《博德之门3》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《双人成行》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《…》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
